  "details": "I find it really tedious to constantly show every avatar I come across, I think it wouldn't be an issue for players if you could auto-show very poor ranked avatars. Since we can already choose between medium and poor, I feel like players not concerned with performance should be allowed to pick \"very poor performance\" rank for the minimum displayed performance rank option. I don't see how this could be a bother to people who don't want this option, as they could just choose \"poor\" or \"medium\" in the same menu.",
